<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;So for example, if the user enters -3, all the lines in the file that begin with a numerical value that is greater than 3 will be excluded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Or if the user enters the value 1, all lines beginning with a value greater than 1 will be excluded.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
